{"id":"01a0657e-1367-7331-938e-e5b1e33de55a","chapterSlug":"rw4-30","paragraph":213,"wording":"[General of the Line]","event":"named","holderSlug":"zel-shivertail","holderQuote":"He was a [General of the Line], a protector of his people. And they were dying while he took cover. Zel clenched his fist."}
